        "Appearance": "Abyssal Steel appears as a deep, lightless metal with a faint blue-black tone. Its surface absorbs light completely, with subtle ripples forming across it like a calm, endless ocean.\n\nWhen observed closely, the metal seems to distort depth, as if it extends far beyond its physical form.\n\n---",
        "Lore": "Forged within the depths of the Abyssal Realm, Abyssal Steel is shaped under immense pressure where energy collapses inward rather than radiating outward.\n\nIt is said that each ingot carries the weight of the abyss itself, making it one of the most oppressive materials known.\n\n---",
