      "searchTerms": "aluminum ingot item resources & materials metal metal ingots {\"title\":\"aluminum ingot\",\"slug\":\"aluminum-ingot\",\"type\":\"item\",\"kingdom\":\"material\",\"itemclass\":\"uncommon\",\"category\":\"ingot\",\"subcategory\":\"metal\",\"materialtype\":\"metal\",\"materialform\":\"ingot\",\"materialfamily\":\"aluminum\",\"sourceitems\":[\"aluminum ore\"],\"weight\":\"0.6kg\",\"weightclass\":\"very light\",\"durability\":\"low\",\"enchantmentaffinity\":\"25% (+2 dice)\",\"damagemodifier\":1,\"armormodifier\":1,\"marketvalue\":\"18 marks\",\"tags\":[\"items\",\"materials\",\"metal\",\"ingot\",\"uncommon\"],\"visibility\":\"public\"} # aluminum ingot\n\n## effect\naluminum is an extremely lightweight metal that enhances speed, mobility, and responsiveness. it sacrifices durability for agility, making it ideal for fast-paced combat styles and aerial or evasive gear.\n\n---\n\n## crafting use\n- light armor\n- mobility gear\n- artificer components\n- flight / movement devices\n\n---\n\n## material traits\n- extremely lightweight  \n- highly resistant to corrosion  \n- poor durability under heavy stress  \n- excellent electrical conductivity  \n\n---\n\n## alloy use\n- lightweight alloys (future)\n- speed-enhanced equipment\n\n---\n\n## enchantment use\n- enhances air and lightning effects  \n- boosts movement-based abilities  \n- reduces activation delay in enchantments  \n\n---\n\n## combat integration\n- +1 damage modifier (weapons)\n- +1 armor modifier (armor)\n- increases mobility-focused builds (system-side)\n\n---\n\n## crafting source\n- requires: 4x [[aluminum ore]]\n\n---\n\n## quote\n*\"lighter than steel — faster than thought.\"*"
