      "content": "---\ntitle: Brass Ingot\nslug: brass-ingot\ntype: item\nkingdom: Material\nitem_class: Common\ncategory: Ingot\nsubcategory: Metal\nmaterial_type: Metal\nmaterial_form: Ingot (Alloy)\nmaterial_family: Brass\nsource_items:\n  - Copper Ingot\n  - Zinc Ingot\nweight: 1.0kg\nweight_class: Light\ndurability: Low\nenchantment_affinity: \"20% (+1 dice)\"\nmarket_value: 14 Marks\ntags:\n  - items\n  - materials\n  - metal\n  - ingot\n  - common\nvisibility: public\n---\n\n# Brass Ingot\n\n## Effect\nBrass is a flexible, resonance-rich alloy that enhances vibration, sound, and heat-based interactions. It is widely used in mechanisms, constructs, and arcane devices, while still being viable for light equipment.\n\n---\n\n## Crafting Use\n- Mechanical components\n- Artificer constructs\n- Instruments\n- Light weapons\n- Light armor\n\n---\n\n## Material Traits\n- Highly flexible and easy to shape  \n- Moderate resistance to corrosion  \n- Excellent sound and heat conductivity  \n- Cannot withstand sustained heavy impact  \n\n---\n\n## Alloy Composition\n- 1x [[Copper Ingot]]\n- 1x [[Zinc Ingot]]\n\n---\n\n## Enchantment Use\n- Enhances:\n  - Sound-based effects\n  - Heat / Fire interactions\n  - Vibration-based abilities  \n- Improves responsiveness of triggered enchantments  \n- Less stable under heavy strain  \n\n---\n\n## Combat Notes\n- Suitable for:\n  - Daggers\n  - Light blades\n  - Decorative armor  \n- Not suitable for:\n  - Heavy weapons\n  - Heavy armor  \n\n---\n\n## Crafting Source\n- Requires:\n  - 1x [[Copper Ingot]]\n  - 1x [[Zinc Ingot]]\n\n---\n\n## Quote\n*\"Where heat and harmony meet, brass sings.\"*\n",
