      "content": "---\ntitle: Chromium Ingot\nslug: chromium-ingot\ntype: item\nkingdom: Material\nitem_class: Uncommon\ncategory: Ingot\nsubcategory: Metal\nmaterial_type: Metal\nmaterial_form: Ingot\nmaterial_family: Chromium\nsource_items:\n  - Chromium Ore\nweight: 1.2kg\nweight_class: Medium\ndurability: High\nenchantment_affinity: \"15% (+1 dice)\"\ndamage_modifier: 1\narmor_modifier: 2\nmarket_value: 18 Marks\ntags:\n  - items\n  - materials\n  - metal\n  - ingot\n  - uncommon\nvisibility: public\n---\n\n# Chromium Ingot\n\n## Effect\nChromium Ingots are used to reinforce metals, increasing durability and resistance to environmental and structural damage. While not suited for raw offensive power, they significantly enhance defensive properties.\n\n---\n\n## Crafting Use\n- Armor reinforcement  \n- Structural components  \n- Alloy enhancement (High Steel)  \n- Defensive equipment  \n\n---\n\n## Material Traits\n- Excellent corrosion resistance  \n- Strengthens alloy integrity  \n- Maintains form under stress  \n- Slightly heavier than standard metals  \n\n---\n\n## Alloy Use\n- [[High Steel Ingot]]\n\n---\n\n## Enchantment Use\n- Improves enchantment durability  \n- Reduces wear from repeated magical use  \n- Supports defensive enchantments  \n\n---\n\n## Combat Integration\n- +1 Damage Modifier  \n- +2 Armor Modifier  \n- Strong defensive-focused material  \n\n---\n\n## Crafting Source\n- Requires: 4x [[Chromium Ore]]\n\n---\n\n## Quote\n*\"Strength is not in the strike — but in what endures it.\"*\n",
      "body": "# Chromium Ingot\n\n## Effect\nChromium Ingots are used to reinforce metals, increasing durability and resistance to environmental and structural damage. While not suited for raw offensive power, they significantly enhance defensive properties.\n\n---\n\n## Crafting Use\n- Armor reinforcement  \n- Structural components  \n- Alloy enhancement (High Steel)  \n- Defensive equipment  \n\n---\n\n## Material Traits\n- Excellent corrosion resistance  \n- Strengthens alloy integrity  \n- Maintains form under stress  \n- Slightly heavier than standard metals  \n\n---\n\n## Alloy Use\n- [[High Steel Ingot]]\n\n---\n\n## Enchantment Use\n- Improves enchantment durability  \n- Reduces wear from repeated magical use  \n- Supports defensive enchantments  \n\n---\n\n## Combat Integration\n- +1 Damage Modifier  \n- +2 Armor Modifier  \n- Strong defensive-focused material  \n\n---\n\n## Crafting Source\n- Requires: 4x [[Chromium Ore]]\n\n---\n\n## Quote\n*\"Strength is not in the strike — but in what endures it.\"*",
