        "Crafting Use": "- Shadow-aligned weapons  \n- Assassin or stealth armor  \n- Arcane tools for Dark magic users  \n- Precision-based equipment  \n\n---",
        "Material Traits": "- Lightweight with strong structural integrity  \n- Absorbs and redistributes light across its surface  \n- Becomes more effective in darkness  \n- Slightly unstable under intense radiant exposure  \n\n---",
        "Enchantment Use": "- Exceptional affinity with **Dark** magic  \n- Enhances:\n  - Shadow manipulation  \n  - Concealment effects  \n  - Precision-based enchantments  \n- Weak synergy with Light or Radiant enchantments  \n\n---",
        "Combat Integration": "- +3 Damage Modifier  \n- +2 Armor Modifier  \n- Favours precision, stealth, and shadow builds  \n\n---",
