        "Enchantment Use": "- Exceptional affinity with:\n  - Fire\n  - Water\n  - Earth\n  - Air\n  - Light\n  - Dark\n  - Life\n  - Death\n- Enhances:\n  - Multi-element enchantments  \n  - Mana stability  \n  - Elemental channeling  \n- Difficult to corrupt or destabilise  \n\n---",
