      "content": "---\ntitle: Moonstone Ingot\nslug: moonstone-ingot\ntype: item\nkingdom: Material\nitem_class: Rare\ncategory: Ingot\nsubcategory: Metal\nmaterial_type: Metal\nmaterial_form: Ingot\nmaterial_family: Moonstone\nsource_items:\n  - Moonstone Ore\nweight: 0.9kg\nweight_class: Light\ndurability: High\nenchantment_affinity: \"70% (+5 dice)\"\ndamage_modifier: 3\narmor_modifier: 3\nmarket_value: 72 Marks\ntags:\n  - items\n  - materials\n  - metal\n  - ingot\n  - rare\nvisibility: public\n---\n\n# Moonstone Ingot\n\n## Effect\nMoonstone Ingots produce a refined metal that harmonises magical energy, making it ideal for balanced builds that combine offense, defense, and spellcasting.\n\n---\n## Appearance\nMoonstone Ingots are refined into smooth, softly luminous bars with a pearlescent sheen. The surface reflects light in shifting tones of white, silver, and pale blue, creating a calm, flowing glow rather than a sharp reflection.\n\nWhen held, the light within the metal seems to pulse gently, as though echoing a distant rhythm, giving the ingot a sense of balance between stillness and motion.\n\n---\n## Crafting Use\n- Hybrid weapons (physical + magic)  \n- Balanced armor  \n- Celestial and arcane equipment  \n- Spellcasting focus items  \n\n---\n\n## Material Traits\n- Lightweight with strong structural stability  \n- Maintains balance between opposing energies  \n- Adapts subtly to magical input  \n- Resistant to magical overload or instability  \n\n---\n\n## Enchantment Use\n- Exceptional affinity with **Celestial and Arcane** magic  \n- Enhances:\n  - Hybrid enchantments  \n  - Multi-effect enchantments  \n  - Balanced spellcasting systems  \n- Reduces risk of enchantment failure  \n\n---\n\n## Combat Integration\n- +3 Damage Modifier  \n- +3 Armor Modifier  \n- Ideal for hybrid and balanced builds  \n\n---\n\n## Crafting Source\n- Requires: 4x [[Moonstone Ore]]\n\n---\n\n## Quote\n*\"Between light and shadow, it finds its truth.\"*\n",
      "body": "# Moonstone Ingot\n\n## Effect\nMoonstone Ingots produce a refined metal that harmonises magical energy, making it ideal for balanced builds that combine offense, defense, and spellcasting.\n\n---\n## Appearance\nMoonstone Ingots are refined into smooth, softly luminous bars with a pearlescent sheen. The surface reflects light in shifting tones of white, silver, and pale blue, creating a calm, flowing glow rather than a sharp reflection.\n\nWhen held, the light within the metal seems to pulse gently, as though echoing a distant rhythm, giving the ingot a sense of balance between stillness and motion.\n\n---\n## Crafting Use\n- Hybrid weapons (physical + magic)  \n- Balanced armor  \n- Celestial and arcane equipment  \n- Spellcasting focus items  \n\n---\n\n## Material Traits\n- Lightweight with strong structural stability  \n- Maintains balance between opposing energies  \n- Adapts subtly to magical input  \n- Resistant to magical overload or instability  \n\n---\n\n## Enchantment Use\n- Exceptional affinity with **Celestial and Arcane** magic  \n- Enhances:\n  - Hybrid enchantments  \n  - Multi-effect enchantments  \n  - Balanced spellcasting systems  \n- Reduces risk of enchantment failure  \n\n---\n\n## Combat Integration\n- +3 Damage Modifier  \n- +3 Armor Modifier  \n- Ideal for hybrid and balanced builds  \n\n---\n\n## Crafting Source\n- Requires: 4x [[Moonstone Ore]]\n\n---\n\n## Quote\n*\"Between light and shadow, it finds its truth.\"*",
