      "content": "---\ntitle: Steel Ingot\nslug: steel-ingot\ntype: item\nkingdom: Material\nitem_class: Uncommon\ncategory: Ingot\nsubcategory: Metal\nmaterial_type: Metal\nmaterial_form: Ingot (Alloy)\nmaterial_family: Steel\nsource_items:\n  - Iron Ingot\n  - Carbon\nweight: 1.3kg\nweight_class: Medium\ndurability: High\nenchantment_affinity: \"20% (+1 dice)\"\ndamage_modifier: 2\narmor_modifier: 2\nmarket_value: 24 Marks\ntags:\n  - items\n  - materials\n  - metal\n  - ingot\n  - uncommon\nvisibility: public\n---\n\n# Steel Ingot\n\n## Effect\nSteel is a refined alloy that balances strength, flexibility, and durability. It represents the first major advancement beyond raw metals, providing a reliable foundation for combat equipment and advanced craftsmanship.\n\n---\n\n## Crafting Use\n- Weapons (standard tier)\n- Armor (medium to heavy)\n- Tools and structural components\n- Mechanical frameworks\n\n---\n\n## Material Traits\n- Stronger and more flexible than Iron  \n- Holds an edge significantly better than base metals  \n- Resistant to warping and fracture under stress  \n- Reliable across both combat and utility applications  \n\n---\n\n## Alloy Composition\n- 1x [[Iron Ingot]]\n- Carbon (Refinement Catalyst)\n\n---\n\n## Enchantment Use\n- Supports low to mid-tier enchantments  \n- Stable under repeated magical use  \n- Does not amplify magic, but maintains consistency  \n\n---\n\n## Combat Integration\n- +2 Damage Modifier (weapons)\n- +2 Armor Modifier (armor)\n- Baseline Uncommon combat material\n\n---\n\n## Crafting Source\n- Requires:\n  - 1x [[Iron Ingot]]\n  - Carbon\n\n---\n\n## Quote\n*\"Iron endures — steel perfects.\"*\n",
      "body": "# Steel Ingot\n\n## Effect\nSteel is a refined alloy that balances strength, flexibility, and durability. It represents the first major advancement beyond raw metals, providing a reliable foundation for combat equipment and advanced craftsmanship.\n\n---\n\n## Crafting Use\n- Weapons (standard tier)\n- Armor (medium to heavy)\n- Tools and structural components\n- Mechanical frameworks\n\n---\n\n## Material Traits\n- Stronger and more flexible than Iron  \n- Holds an edge significantly better than base metals  \n- Resistant to warping and fracture under stress  \n- Reliable across both combat and utility applications  \n\n---\n\n## Alloy Composition\n- 1x [[Iron Ingot]]\n- Carbon (Refinement Catalyst)\n\n---\n\n## Enchantment Use\n- Supports low to mid-tier enchantments  \n- Stable under repeated magical use  \n- Does not amplify magic, but maintains consistency  \n\n---\n\n## Combat Integration\n- +2 Damage Modifier (weapons)\n- +2 Armor Modifier (armor)\n- Baseline Uncommon combat material\n\n---\n\n## Crafting Source\n- Requires:\n  - 1x [[Iron Ingot]]\n  - Carbon\n\n---\n\n## Quote\n*\"Iron endures — steel perfects.\"*",
