      "searchTerms": "thorium ingot item resources & materials metal metal ingots {\"title\":\"thorium ingot\",\"slug\":\"thorium-ingot\",\"type\":\"item\",\"kingdom\":\"material\",\"itemclass\":\"unusual\",\"category\":\"ingot\",\"subcategory\":\"metal\",\"materialtype\":\"metal\",\"materialform\":\"ingot\",\"materialfamily\":\"thorium\",\"sourceitems\":[\"thorium ore\"],\"weight\":\"1.6kg\",\"weightclass\":\"medium-heavy\",\"durability\":\"very high\",\"enchantmentaffinity\":\"45% (+3 dice)\",\"damagemodifier\":3,\"armormodifier\":3,\"marketvalue\":\"70 marks\",\"tags\":[\"items\",\"materials\",\"metal\",\"ingot\",\"unusual\"],\"visibility\":\"public\"} # thorium ingot\n\n## effect\nthorium is a mana-charged metal that stores and releases energy. it enhances magical output while providing strong defensive properties.\n\n---\n\n## crafting use\n- arcane armor\n- energy weapons\n- magical cores\n- runic systems\n\n---\n\n## material traits\n- stores residual magical energy  \n- resistant to heat and arcane decay  \n- requires careful handling due to instability  \n- dense and highly durable  \n\n---\n\n## enchantment use\n- enhances radiant and arcane effects  \n- supports high-output enchantments  \n- can store spell energy  \n\n---\n\n## combat integration\n- +3 damage modifier  \n- +3 armor modifier  \n- favours magic-heavy builds  \n\n---\n\n## crafting source\n- requires: 4x [[thorium ore]]\n\n---\n\n## quote\n*\"power given form — and barely contained.\"*"
