      "sourceFolder": "content/minerals/3-unusual/ores/cobalt-ore",
      "content": "---\ntitle: Cobalt Ore\nslug: cobalt-ore\ntype: item\nkingdom: Mineral\nitem_class: Unusual\ncategory: Ore\nsubcategory: Metal\nmaterial_type: Metal\nmaterial_form: Ore\nmaterial_family: Cobalt\nsource_items: []\nrefines_into: Cobalt Ingot\nrefinement_ratio: \"4:1\"\nweight_class: Medium\ndurability: High\nenchantment_affinity: \"30% (+2 dice)\"\nmarket_value: 12 Marks\ntags:\n  - items\n  - minerals\n  - metal\n  - ore\n  - unusual\nvisibility: public\n---\n\n# Cobalt Ore\n\n## Effect\nCobalt Ore is infused with latent arcane energy, allowing it to conduct and amplify mana when refined. It serves as a key material for enchantment-focused metals and arcane equipment.\n\n---\n\n## Lore\nDeep within storm-touched mountains, cobalt forms where lightning and stone meet. Ancient smiths believed it to be a “sleeping metal,” awakened only through magic and heat.\n\n---\n\n## Material & Crafting Traits\n- Naturally conductive to magical energy  \n- Stable under high-temperature refinement  \n- Resistant to arcane degradation  \n- Often found near lightning-rich or mana-dense regions  \n\n---\n\n## Refinement\n- Smelts into: [[Cobalt Ingot]]\n- Ratio: 4 Ore → 1 Ingot\n- Notes: Responds well to magically stabilised forges\n\n---\n\n## Alloy Use\n- Advanced enchantment alloys (future)\n\n---\n\n## Enchantment Use\n- Enhances Lightning and Ice magic  \n- Improves mana flow in crafted items  \n\n---\n\n## Quote\n*\"Within the stone sleeps the storm.\"*\n",
      "body": "# Cobalt Ore\n\n## Effect\nCobalt Ore is infused with latent arcane energy, allowing it to conduct and amplify mana when refined. It serves as a key material for enchantment-focused metals and arcane equipment.\n\n---\n\n## Lore\nDeep within storm-touched mountains, cobalt forms where lightning and stone meet. Ancient smiths believed it to be a “sleeping metal,” awakened only through magic and heat.\n\n---\n\n## Material & Crafting Traits\n- Naturally conductive to magical energy  \n- Stable under high-temperature refinement  \n- Resistant to arcane degradation  \n- Often found near lightning-rich or mana-dense regions  \n\n---\n\n## Refinement\n- Smelts into: [[Cobalt Ingot]]\n- Ratio: 4 Ore → 1 Ingot\n- Notes: Responds well to magically stabilised forges\n\n---\n\n## Alloy Use\n- Advanced enchantment alloys (future)\n\n---\n\n## Enchantment Use\n- Enhances Lightning and Ice magic  \n- Improves mana flow in crafted items  \n\n---\n\n## Quote\n*\"Within the stone sleeps the storm.\"*",
