        "Final Words of Pixie Lore": "> *“We are not small because we are weak.  We are small so the world forgets to fear us.”*  \n> — Old Pixie Proverb\n\n\n> *“We are not small because we are weak.  We are small so the world forgets to fear us.”*  \n> — Old Pixie Proverb",
        "🧠 Notes": "- Native to **Avalon (Fae Realm)**  \n- Do not form structured societies  \n\nCommon habitats:\n- Elemental groves  \n- Floating crystal formations  \n- Hidden fae sanctuaries  \n\nValues:\n- Freedom  \n- Expression  \n- Balance with nature  \n- Soul connection\n\n\n- Native to **Avalon (Fae Realm)**  \n- Do not form structured societies  \n\nCommon habitats:\n- Elemental groves  \n- Floating crystal formations  \n- Hidden fae sanctuaries  \n\nValues:\n- Freedom  \n- Expression  \n- Balance with nature  \n- Soul connection",
        "Racial Features": "- Height Range:\n  - 15 cm to 60 cm  \n\n- Weight Range:\n  - 2 kg to 6 kg  \n\n- Wings:\n  - Insect-like, semi-translucent magical wings  \n  - Shape varies depending on elemental affinity  \n\n- Skin:\n  - Soft, glowing, slightly translucent  \n  - Colour Range:\n    - Pastel → vibrant → elemental hues  \n\n- Hair:\n  - Light, flowing as if weightless  \n  - Colour Range:\n    - White → silver → elemental tones  \n\n- Eyes:\n  - Bright and glowing with elemental energy  \n  - Colour Range:\n    - Matches elemental affinity  \n\n- Hands:\n  - Tiny, delicate fingers  \n  - Highly precise control for fine manipulation  \n\n- Face:\n  - Soft, expressive features  \n  - Emotions often visible through subtle glow changes  \n\n- Ears:\n  - Small and pointed  \n\n- Markings:\n  - Faint glowing patterns tied to elemental nature  \n\n- Body:\n  - Extremely lightweight  \n  - Movements are erratic, fluttering, and quick  \n\n---",
        "Racial Characteristics": "| Characteristic | Buff/Debuff | Stat Rolls | Characteristic Tier Cap |\n| -------------- | :---------: | :--------: | :---------------------: |\n| Strength       |     -3      |    2d4     |         Tier 1          |\n| Dexterity      |     +1      |    4d6     |         Tier 5          |\n| Agility        |     +2      |    4d6     |         Tier 5          |\n| Constitution   |     -2      |    2d4     |         Tier 3          |\n| Endurance      |      0      |    2d4     |         Tier 3          |\n| Intelligence   |     +1      |    4d6     |         Tier 5          |\n| Wisdom         |      0      |    4d6     |         Tier 5          |\n| Charisma       |     +1      |    4d6     |         Tier 5          |\n| Luck           |      0      |    3d6     |         Tier 5          |\n\n---",
        "Racial Traits": "### Magical Affinity (Innate)\n- Born with **100 Affinity** in one elemental type  \n- Cannot be changed or reduced  \n- Reduced backlash from aligned magic  \n\n### Racial Bond – Split Soul\nPixies are born with **half a soul**.\n\n- The other half manifests as a **Sprite**\n- Pixie and Sprite can sense one another across great distances\n- When within close proximity, magic flows more smoothly\n\nIf the bond is damaged or severed, the Pixie and/or Sprite becomes **Unstable**, suffering narrative and mechanical consequences.\n\n### Elemental Embodiment\n- Emotions influence environment slightly  \n- Enhances nearby aligned magic  \n- Discomfort when exposed to opposing elements  \n\n### Fae Perception\n- Detect:\n  - Illusions  \n  - Glamours  \n  - Magical distortions  \n- Strong intuition for hidden intent  \n- Struggles with rigid systems or logic  \n\n---",
        "Lore": "# Pixie Lore\n\nPixies are among the **oldest manifested fae** known to exist, born not of flesh but of **Avalon’s will and magic**. They are living expressions of elemental harmony, curiosity, and the unstable boundary between realms.\n\nThough small in stature, pixies have left **outsized marks on history**, often unnoticed by mortals until centuries later.\n\n---",
