      "content": "---\ntitle: \"False Description\"\nslug: \"false-description\"\ntype: talent\nclassName: \"Artificer\"\nclassSlug: \"artificer\"\nclassCategory: \"Magical Classes\"\ntalentTier: \"Tier 2\"\ntier: \"Tier 2\"\nranks: 5\nprerequisite: \"Item Analysis or Artificer Discipline Rank 2\"\ncost: \"1 Talent Point\"\ncooldown: \"Passive\"\nscaling: \"Improves crafted misdirection, disguised functions, and misleading item reads.\"\nsynergy: \"Pairs with traps, hidden devices, deceptive enchantments, and rogue-style preparation.\"\ntags:\n  - \"talent\"\n  - \"artificer\"\n  - \"tier-2\"\nvisibility: public\nsourceOrder: 7\n---\n\n# False Description\n\n## Overview\nImproves crafted misdirection, disguised functions, and misleading item reads.\n\n## Rank 1\nCreate simple false readings or misleading item descriptions.\n\n## Rank 2\nImprove hidden function masking.\n\n## Rank 3\nBuild more convincing deceptive item signatures.\n\n## Rank 4\nMask complex crafted or enchanted functions.\n\n## Rank 5\nMaster high-grade deception for Artificer creations.\n\n## Prerequisites\nItem Analysis or Artificer Discipline Rank 2\n\n## Scaling\nImproves crafted misdirection, disguised functions, and misleading item reads.\n\n## Synergy\nPairs with traps, hidden devices, deceptive enchantments, and rogue-style preparation.\n\n## GM Notes\nInformation coming soon\n",
