      "content": "---\ntitle: \"Reverse Engineering\"\nslug: \"reverse-engineering\"\ntype: talent\nclassName: \"Artificer\"\nclassSlug: \"artificer\"\nclassCategory: \"Magical Classes\"\ntalentTier: \"Tier 3\"\ntier: \"Tier 3\"\nranks: 5\nprerequisite: \"Item Analysis Rank 2\"\ncost: \"1 Talent Point\"\ncooldown: \"Cantrip / GM-defined\"\nscaling: \"Reverse Engineering rolls and knowledge fragment recovery improve by rank.\"\nsynergy: \"Destroys items to learn schematics, formulas, and construction principles.\"\ntags:\n  - \"talent\"\n  - \"artificer\"\n  - \"tier-3\"\nvisibility: public\nsourceOrder: 13\n---\n\n# Reverse Engineering\n\n## Overview\nReverse Engineering rolls and knowledge fragment recovery improve by rank.\n\n## Rank 1\nSpend MP to destroy an eligible item and attempt to gain a knowledge fragment.\n\n## Rank 2\nImprove Reverse Engineering rolls and fragment recovery.\n\n## Rank 3\nStudy more complex crafted, alchemical, and enchanted objects.\n\n## Rank 4\nRecover deeper schematic and formula knowledge.\n\n## Rank 5\nMaster destructive study of advanced creations.\n\n## Prerequisites\nItem Analysis Rank 2\n\n## Scaling\nReverse Engineering rolls and knowledge fragment recovery improve by rank.\n\n## Synergy\nDestroys items to learn schematics, formulas, and construction principles.\n\n## GM Notes\nInformation coming soon\n",
