      "content": "---\ntitle: \"Soul Bond Object\"\nslug: \"soul-bond-object\"\ntype: talent\nclassName: \"Artificer\"\nclassSlug: \"artificer\"\nclassCategory: \"Magical Classes\"\ntalentTier: \"Tier 3\"\ntier: \"Tier 3\"\nranks: 5\nprerequisite: \"Soul Stone access and Artificer Discipline Rank 3\"\ncost: \"1 Talent Point\"\ncooldown: \"Passive\"\nscaling: \"Soul-bound object stability and capability improve by rank.\"\nsynergy: \"Feeds Soul Integration, enchanted item growth, scaling creations, and advanced campaign artifacts.\"\ntags:\n  - \"talent\"\n  - \"artificer\"\n  - \"tier-3\"\nvisibility: public\nsourceOrder: 14\n---\n\n# Soul Bond Object\n\n## Overview\nSoul-bound object stability and capability improve by rank.\n\n## Rank 1\nBind a simple object to a soul catalyst or soul-linked function.\n\n## Rank 2\nImprove stability and connection strength.\n\n## Rank 3\nAdd more meaningful soul-linked properties.\n\n## Rank 4\nSupport complex bonded object behavior.\n\n## Rank 5\nMaster high-grade Soul-Bound object creation.\n\n## Prerequisites\nSoul Stone access and Artificer Discipline Rank 3\n\n## Scaling\nSoul-bound object stability and capability improve by rank.\n\n## Synergy\nFeeds Soul Integration, enchanted item growth, scaling creations, and advanced campaign artifacts.\n\n## GM Notes\nInformation coming soon\n",
